#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:3
#: 6ec1b1486151426288776dd39baa24c9
msgid "本页教你为 Make Dataset 模块开发一张新卡片，按当前的 Operation/Params 架构拆分 UI 和业务逻辑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/custom-card-development.md:5
